    "source_type": "webpage",
    "text": "Healthcare Fraud Prevention Partnership\nThrough data and information sharing, the Healthcare Fraud Prevention Partnership (HFPP) fosters a proactive approach to combat healthcare fraud, waste, and abuse.\nOverview of the Partnership\nWant to learn more about the HFPP program and studies process?\nWatch the Video\nHFPP Events\nOne of the core benefits of the HFPP is collaboration with other partners through a variety of regional events, webinars, working groups, and other planned activities.\nExecutive Board Meeting - June 11, 2026\nVisit our events page for more information about these and other HFPP events.\nView More Events\nReport for Congress\nRead the biennial report (PDF) on the Healthcare Fraud Prevention Partnership’s efforts to identify and reduce fraud, waste, and abuse across the healthcare sector through collaboration, data and information sharing, and cross-payer research studies.\nView Report (PDF)\nAbout HFPP\nLearn more about the HFPP .\nHow to become a Partner .\nAbout HFPP"
