    "text": "Focused Program Integrity Reviews by State or Territory\nFocused Program Integrity Reviews\nCMS conducts focused reviews to assess the state’s program integrity oversight efforts of high-risk areas. These reviews specifically assess the state’s compliance with CMS regulatory requirements. A secondary objective of these reviews is to provide the state with feedback, technical assistance, and educational resources that may be used to enhance program integrity in the delivery of high-risk areas. At the conclusion of the reviews, CMS drafts a review report and reviews the state's feedback and consequently publishes the reports below.\nState / Territory\nFiscal Year\nDate of Report\nFocus Area\nState / Territory Ohio\nFiscal Year 2024\nDate of Report 2026-05-07\nFocus Area Focused: Personal Care Services\nState / Territory Maine\nFiscal Year 2024\nDate of Report 2026-02-04\nFocus Area Focused: Personal Care Services\nState / Territory Montana\nFiscal Year 2024\nDate of Report 2025-12-16\nFocus Area Focused: Personal Care Services\nState / Territory Arkansas\nFiscal Year 2023\nDate of Report 2025-12-01\nFocus Area Focused: Personal Care Services\nState / Territory Idaho\nFiscal Year 2023\nDate of Report 2025-11-14\nFocus Area Focused: Managed Care\nState / Territory New York\nFiscal Year 2023\nDate of Report 2025-11-14\nFocus Area Focused: Managed Care\nState / Territory Delaware\nFiscal Year 2023\nDate of Report 2025-09-16\nFocus Area Focused: Managed Care\nState / Territory Georgia\nFiscal Year 2023\nDate of Report 2025-08-29\nFocus Area Focused: Managed Care\nState / Territory Oregon\nFiscal Year 2023\nDate of Report 2025-08-28\nFocus Area Focused: Managed Care\nState / Territory Florida\nFiscal Year 2022\nDate of Report 2025-08-27\nFocus Area Focused: Managed Care\nState / Territory Texas\nFiscal Year 2023\nDate of Report 2025-08-26\nFocus Area Focused: Managed Care\nState / Territory Tennessee\nFiscal Year 2024\nDate of Report 2025-07-31\nFocus Area Focu