    "url": "https://www.cms.gov/data-research/monitoring-programs/medicare-fee-service-compliance-programs/medical-review-and-education/master-list-dmepos-items-potentially-subject-conditions-payment",
    "source_type": "webpage",
    "text": "Master List of Durable Medical Equipment, Prosthetics, Orthotics and Supplies (DMEPOS) Items Potentially Subject to Conditions of Payment\nCMS has streamlined regulatory requirements to help simplify DMEPOS payment requirements and reduce provider and supplier burden. The Master List serves as a library of Fee-for-Service DMEPOS codes that were flagged as potential vulnerabilities based on the criteria outlined in CMS-1713-F .\nAs of April 13, 2026, the Master List includes 530 items. View the Master List (PDF) .\nWhat Does the Master List Mean for Providers and Suppliers?\nProviders and suppliers don’t need to take action unless an item on the Master List also appears on one or both Required Lists :\nRequired Prior Authorization List (PDF) As of April 13, 2026, this list includes 74 items.\nRequired Face-to-Face Encounter and Written Order Prior to Delivery List (PDF) As of April 13, 2026, this list includes 83 items.\nThe Required Lists Comparison Chart (PDF) is a side-by-side crosswalk of both Required Lists.\nMaster List Life Cycle\nHCPCS Code\nOn Master List?\nPrior Authorization Required?\nPA Effective Dates\nF2F and Written Order Prior to Delivery?\nF2F and WOPD Effective Dates\nHCPCS Code A4342\nOn Master List? Yes\nPrior Authorization Required? No\nPA Effective Dates N/A\nF2F and Written Order Prior to Delivery? No\nF2F and WOPD Effective Dates N/A\nHCPCS Code A4352\nOn Master List? Yes\nPrior Authorization Required? No\nPA Effective Dates N/A\nF2F and Written Order Prior to Delivery? No\nF2F and WOPD Effective Dates N/A\nHCPCS Code E0193\nOn Master List? Yes\nPrior Authorization Required? Yes\nPA Effective Dates P1: 07/22/2019\nF2F and Written Order Prior to Delivery? No\nF2F and WOPD Effective Dates N/A\nHCPCS Code E0747\nOn Master List? Yes\nPrior Authorization Required? Yes\nPA Effective Dates P1: 08/12/2024\nF2F and Written Order Prior to Delivery? Yes\nF2F and WOPD Effective Dates 08/12/2024\nHCPCS Code L2628\nOn Master List? Yes\nPrior A