    "text": "Medicaid Integrity Program\nEducational Resources\nResources by Audience Resources for SMAs Toolkits for Providers Resources for Beneficiaries\nResources for SMAs\nToolkits for Providers\nResources for Beneficiaries\nResources by Topic Beneficiary Card Sharing Risks Best Practices for SMAs Dental Documentation Hospice Infographics Non-Emergency Medical Transport Nursing Homes Personal Care Services Provider Requirements\nBeneficiary Card Sharing Risks\nBest Practices for SMAs\nDental\nDocumentation\nHospice\nInfographics\nNon-Emergency Medical Transport\nNursing Homes\nPersonal Care Services\nProvider Requirements\nResource Library Resource Archives\nResource Archives\nHospice Booklet for Beneficiaries\nThis resource is part of the Hospice Benefit toolkit, which contains resources for both providers and beneficiaries. For your convenience, all of the toolkit resources are listed below.\nDownloads\nHospice Booklet for Beneficiaries\nHospice Fact Sheet for Beneficiaries\nHospice Fact Sheet for Providers\nHospice Checklist for Providers\nPalliative Care vs. Hospice Care"
