    "url": "https://www.cms.gov/training-education/medicare-learning-networkr-mln/compliance",
    "source_type": "webpage",
    "text": "Provider Compliance\nLearn how to avoid common coverage, coding, and billing errors with these educational resources:\nCERT Outreach & Education Task Force\nMedicare Provider Compliance Tips educational tool\nQuickly learn about compliance issues and avoid common billing errors\nMedicare Improperly Paid Suppliers for Intermittent Urinary Catheters\nSkilled Nursing Facilities: Identify & Prevent Improper Part D Payments for Drugs\nRemote Patient Monitoring: Use & Bill Correctly\nAcute Care Hospital Outpatient Services for Hospice Enrollees: Reduce Improper Payments\nComprehensive Outpatient Rehabilitation Facility Services: Prevent Claim Denials\nSubscribe to our MLN Connects® newsletter to learn about Medicare coverage, billing, and payment updates for health care providers."
