    "text": "Provider Compliance Messages\nQuickly learn about compliance issues and avoid common billing errors.\nFilter messages by topic or title.\nTitle\nDate\nTitle DMEPOS: Bill Correctly for Continuous Positive Airway Pressure Devices\nDate 2026-06-25\nTitle Dermatologists: Bill Correctly for Evaluation and Management Services & Minor Surgical Procedures\nDate 2026-06-02\nTitle Optometry Services at Nursing Facilities: Bill Correctly\nDate 2026-02-12\nTitle Evaluation and Management Services & Intravitreal Injections: Bill Correctly\nDate 2026-02-12\nTitle Global Surgery: Accurately Report Postoperative Visits\nDate 2026-02-12\nTitle DME: Complying with Proof of Delivery Requirements\nDate 2025-09-04\nTitle Opioid Use Disorder: Learn about Services to Help Your Patients Continue Treatment\nDate 2025-08-04\nTitle Medicare Improperly Paid Suppliers for Intermittent Urinary Catheters\nDate 2025-07-10\nTitle Remote Patient Monitoring: Use & Bill Correctly\nDate 2025-05-15\nTitle Skilled Nursing Facilities: Identify & Prevent Improper Part D Payments for Drugs\nDate 2025-05-15\nTitle Acute Care Hospital Outpatient Services for Hospice Enrollees: Reduce Improper Payments\nDate 2025-05-05\nTitle Mechanical Ventilation: Bill Correctly for Inpatient Claims\nDate 2024-11-21\nTitle Comprehensive Error Rate Testing Medical Record Requests: Respond Timely\nDate 2024-10-29\nTitle Opioid Treatment Program: Learn How to Bill Medicare\nDate 2024-07-23\nTitle Comprehensive Outpatient Rehabilitation Facility Services: Prevent Claim Denials\nDate 2024-03-07\nTitle Medical Services Authorized by the Veteran’s Health Administration: Avoid Duplicate Payments\nDate 2024-02-22\nTitle Opioid Treatment Program: Bill Correctly for Opioid Use Disorder Treatment Services\nDate 2024-01-25\nTitle Global Surgery: Bill Correctly\nDate 2023-12-21\nTitle Skilled Nursing Facility: Appropriate Use of Place-Of-Service Codes\nDate 2023-11-16\nTitle Critical Access Hospitals: Bill Correctly\nDate 2023-03-23\nTitle Advance Care Planning: Bill Correctly for Services\nDate 2023-03-09\nTitle Home Health Rural Add-On Policy\nDate 2023-01-19\nTitle Bill Correctly: Power Mobility Devices\nDate 2022-12-13\nTitle LAAC & ICD National Coverage Determinations: Submit Proper Documentation\nDate 2022-12-01\nTitle What’s the Comprehensive Error Rate Testing (CERT) Program?\nDate 2022-01-26\nTitle Implanted Spinal Neurostimulators: Document Medical Records\nDate 2021-12-09\nTitle Home Health LUPA Threshold: Bill Correctly\nDate 2021-05-25\nTitle Post-Acute Care Transfers: Bill Correctly\nDate 2021-02-22\nTitle Non-Physician Outpatient Services Provided Before or During Inpatient Stays: Bill Correctly\nDate 2020-12-21\nTitle Creating an Effective Hospice Plan of Care\nDate 2020-08-26\nTitle RN Supervision of Hospice Aide Services\nDate 2020-08-26\nTitle Bill Correctly for Inhalant Drugs\nDate 2020-04-23\nTitle Hospice Care: Safeguards for Medicare Patients\nDate 2020-01-30\nTitle Bill Correctly for Polysomnography Services\nDate 2020-01-16\nTitle Home Health Care: Proper Certification Required\nDate 2018-02-15\nTitle Inpatient Skilled Nursing Facility Denials\nDate 2017-08-18\nTitle Chiropractic Services: High Improper Payment Rate within Medicare FFS Part B\nDate 2017-07-06\nTitle Inpatient Psychiatric Services\nDate 2016-02-22\nTitle Complying with Signature Requirements for Diagnostic Tests\nDate 2013-06-01"
