    "source_type": "webpage",
    "text": "Health Facility Complaints and Provider Compliance Division of Minnesota\nHealth Facility Complaints and Provider Compliance Division of Minnesota\nOrganization type\nNursing Home State Survey Agency\nOrganization description\nWhere to submit a complaint about the quality of life or quality of care inside a nursing home.\nCovered states and territories\nMinnesota\nContact information\nToll Free: (800) 369-7994 Local: (651) 201-4201 Fax: (651) 281-9796 Web Site: https://www.health.state.mn.us Hours: 8:00 am - 4:30 pm\nAbout the contacts directory\nThis application provides access to the CMS.gov Contacts Directory. Search for contacts using the search form ."
