    "source_type": "webpage",
    "text": "PERM Error Rate Findings and Reports\nWelcome to the PERM reports and reference documents page. This page houses various reports and reference documents associated with the PERM program. This page will contain two cycles of improper payment rates spanning six years. For earlier improper payment rates please refer to the Archive page.\nRolling National Medicaid Improper Payment Rates\nYear\nYear\nPERM Cycles Included\nPERM Cycles Included\nEstimated Improper Payments (in billions)\nEstimated Improper Payments (in billions)\nOverall Rate\nOverall Rate\nFFS Rate\nFFS Rate\nManaged Care Rate\nManaged Care Rate\nEligibility Rate\nEligibility Rate\n2025\nCycle 2 - RY 2023 Cycle 3 - RY 2024 Cycle 1 - RY 2025\nCycle 2 - RY 2023\nCycle 3 - RY 2024\nCycle 1 - RY 2025\n$37.39\n6.12%\n4.60%\n0.00%\n4.42%\n2024\nCycle 1 - RY 2022 Cycle 2 - RY 2023 Cycle 3 - RY 2024\nCycle 1 - RY 2022\nCycle 2 - RY 2023\nCycle 3 - RY 2024\n$31.10\n5.09%\n4.83%\n0.00%\n3.31%\n2023\nCycle 3 - RY 2021 Cycle 1 - RY 2022 Cycle 2 - RY 2023\nCycle 3 - RY 2021\nCycle 1 - RY 2022\nCycle 2 - RY 2023\n$50.33\n8.58%\n6.90%\n0.00%\n5.95%\n2022\nCycle 2 - RY 2020 Cycle 3 - RY 2021 Cycle 1 - RY 2022\nCycle 2 - RY 2020\nCycle 3 - RY 2021\nCycle 1 - RY 2022\n$80.57\n15.62%\n10.42%\n0.03%\n11.89%\n2021\nCycle 1 - RY 2019 Cycle 2 - RY 2020 Cycle 3 - RY 2021\nCycle 1 - RY 2019\nCycle 2 - RY 2020\nCycle 3 - RY 2021\n$98.72\n21.69%\n13.90%\n0.04%\n16.62%\n2020\nCycle 3 – FY 2017 Cycle 1 – RY 2019 Cycle 2 – RY 2020\nCycle 3 – FY 2017\nCycle 1 – RY 2019\nCycle 2 – RY 2020\n$86.49\n21.36%\n16.84%\n0.06%\n14.94%\nThe overall estimate is comprised of the weighted sum of the FFS and managed care components, plus the eligibility component, minus a small adjustment to account for the overlap between the claims and eligibility review functions.\nNational Rolling CHIP Improper Payment Rates\nYear\nYear\nPERM Cycles Included\nPERM Cycles Included\nEstimated Improper Payments (in billions)\nEstimated Improper Payments (in billions)\nOverall Rate\nOverall Rate\nFFS Rate\nFFS Rate\nManaged Care Rate\nManaged Care Rate\nEligibility Rate\nEligibility Rate\n2025\nCycle 2 - RY 2023 Cycle 3 - RY 2024 Cycle 1 - RY 2025\nCycle 2 - RY 2023\nCycle 3 - RY 2024\nCycle 1 - RY 2025\n$1.37\n7.05%\n4.65%\n0.94%\n5.23%\n2024\nCycle 1 - RY 2022 Cycle 2 - RY 2023 Cycle 3 - RY 2024\nCycle 1 - RY 2022\nCycle 2 - RY 2023\nCycle 3 - RY 2024\n$1.07\n6.11%\n4.72%\n0.72%\n4.44%\n2023\nCycle 3 - RY 2021 Cycle 1 - RY 2022 Cycle 2 - RY 2023\nCycle 3 - RY 2021\nCycle 1 - RY 2022\nCycle 2 - RY 2023\n$2.14\n12.81%\n7.09%\n0.59%\n10.86%\n2022\nCycle 2 - RY 2020 Cycle 3 - RY 2021 Cycle 1 - RY 2022\nCycle 2 - RY 2020\nCycle 3 - RY 2021\nCycle 1 - RY 2022\n$4.30\n26.75%\n11.23%\n0.62%\n24.01%\n2021\nCycle 1 - RY 2019 Cycle 2 - RY 2020 Cycle 3 - RY 2021\nCycle 1 - RY 2019\nCycle 2 - RY 2020\nCycle 3 - RY 2021\n$5.37\n31.84%\n13.67%\n0.48%\n28.71%\n2020\nCycle 3 – FY 2017 Cycle 1 – RY 2019 Cycle 2 – RY 2020\nCycle 3 – FY 2017\nCycle 1 – RY 2019\nCycle 2 – RY 2020\n$4.78\n27.00%\n14.15%\n0.49%\n23.53%\nThe overall estimate is comprised of the weighted sum of the FFS and managed care components, plus the eligibility component, minus a small adjustment to account for the overlap between the claims and eligibility review functions.\nDownloads\n2025 Medicaid and CHIP Supplemental Improper Payment Data (PDF)\n2025 PERM Medicaid Improper Payment Rates (PDF)\n2025 PERM CHIP Improper Payment Rates (PDF)\n2024 Medicaid and CHIP Supplemental Improper Payment Data (PDF)\n2024 PERM Medicaid Improper Payment Rates (PDF)\n2024 PERM CHIP Improper Payment Rates (PDF)\n2023 Medicaid & CHIP Supplemental Improper Payment Data (PDF)\n2023 PERM Medicaid Improper Payment Rates (PDF)\n2023 PERM CHIP Improper Payment Rates (PDF)\n2022 Medicaid & CHIP Supplemental Improper Payment Data (PDF)\n2022 PERM Medicaid Improper Payment Rates (PDF)\n2022 PERM CHIP Improper Payment Rates (PDF)\n2021 Medicaid & CHIP Supplemental Improper Payment Data (PDF)\n2021 PERM Medicaid Improper Payment Rates (PDF)\n2021 PERM CHIP Improper Payment Rates (PDF)\n2020 Medicaid & CHIP Supplemental Improper Payment Data (PDF)\n2020 PERM Medicaid Improper Payment Rates (PDF)\n2020 PERM CHIP Improper Payment Rates (PDF)"
