    "source_type": "webpage",
    "text": "Part C Reporting Requirements\nThis section contains information related to the Part C reporting requirements. Each Medicare Advantage organization must have an effective procedure to develop, compile, evaluate, and report information to CMS in the time and manner that CMS requires. The Part C reporting requirements and technical specifications describe the required level of reporting, timeframes, deadlines, and specific data elements for each reporting section.\nFinal Part C reporting requirements are posted in the Downloads section of this page.\nDownloads\nCY2026 Part C Technical Specifications (12.01.2025) (PDF)\nCY2026 Part C Reporting Requirements (12.01.2025) (PDF)\nCY 2025 Part C Technical Specifications (PDF)\nCY 2025 Part C Reporting Requirements (PDF)\nCY 2025 Part C Supplemental Benefit Utilization and Costs FAQ (PDF)\nPart C Reporting Requirements and Technical Specifications (Archive) (ZIP)\nRelated Links\nPart D Reporting Requirements\nPart C and Part D Data Validation"
  },
  {
    "title": "Part D Reporting Requirements | CMS",
    "url": "https://www.cms.gov/medicare/coverage/prescription-drug-coverage-contracting/part-d-reporting-requirements",
    "source_type": "webpage",
    "text": "Part D Reporting Requirements\nThis section contains information related to the Part D reporting requirements. Each Part D plan sponsor must have an effective procedure to develop, compile, evaluate, and report information to CMS in the time and manner that CMS requires. The Part D reporting requirements and technical specifications describe the required level of reporting, timeframes, deadlines, and specific data elements for each reporting section.\nFinal Part D reporting requirements are posted in the downloads section of this page.\nDownloads\nCY2026 Part D Technical Specifications (12.01.2025) (PDF)\nCY2026 Part D Reporting Requirements (12.01.2025) (PDF)\nCY2025 Part D Technical Specifications (12.03.2024) (PDF)\nCY2025 Part D Reporting Requirements (12.03.2024) (PDF)\nCY2025 Bene-level MTM Submission Instructions (12.15.2025) (PDF)\nPart D Reporting and Technical Documents (Archive) (ZIP)\nBeneficiary Level MTMP Submission Instructions (Archive) (ZIP)\nRelated Links\nPart C and Part D Data Validation\nPart C Reporting Requirements"
