to Prior Authorization\nWisconsin\nPrior Authorization for Certain Hospital Outpatient Department (OPD) Services\nServiced Involved\nBlepharoplasty\nBotulinum Toxin Injections\nPanniculectomy\nRhinoplasty\nVein Ablation\nImplanted Spinal Neurostimulators\nCervical Fusion with Disc Removal\nFacet Joint Interventions\nFull list of codes\nPrior Authorization of Repetitive, Scheduled Non-Emergent Ambulance Transport\nAdvanced Life Support (ALS), non-emergency ambulance\nBasic Life Support (BLS), non-emergency ambulance\nPrior Authorization Process for Certain Durable Medical Equipment, Prosthetics, Orthotics, and Supplies (DMEPOS) Items\nMaster list of DMEPOs items subject to Prior Authorization\nWyoming\nPrior Authorization for Certain Hospital Outpatient Department (OPD) Services\nServiced Involved\nBlepharoplasty\nBotulinum Toxin Injections\nPanniculectomy\nRhinoplasty\nVein Ablation\nImplanted Spinal Neurostimulators\nCervical Fusion with Disc Removal\nFacet Joint Interventions\nFull list of codes\nPrior Authorization of Repetitive, Scheduled Non-Emergent Ambulance Transport\nAdvanced Life Support (ALS), non-emergency ambulance\nBasic Life Support (BLS), non-emergency ambulance\nPrior Authorization Process for Certain Durable Medical Equipment, Prosthetics, Orthotics, and Supplies (DMEPOS) Items\nMaster list of DMEPOs items subject to Prior Authorization\nDistrict of Columbia\nPrior Authorization for Certain Hospital Outpatient Department (OPD) Services\nServiced Involved\nBlepharoplasty\nBotulinum Toxin Injections\nPanniculectomy\nRhinoplasty\nVein Ablation\nImplanted Spinal Neurostimulators\nCervical Fusion with Disc Removal\nFacet Joint Interventions\nFull list of codes\nPrior Authorization of Repetitive, Scheduled Non-Emergent Ambulance Transport\nAdvanced Life Support (ALS), non-emergency ambulance\nBasic Life Support (BLS), non-emergency ambulance\nPrior Authorization Process for Certain Durable Medical Equipment, Prosthetics, Orthotics, and Supplies (DMEPOS) 