    "title": "HFPP Events | CMS",
    "url": "https://www.cms.gov/medicare/medicaid-coordination/healthcare-fraud-prevention-partnership/events",
    "source_type": "webpage",
    "text": "HFPP Events\nOne of the core benefits of the HFPP is collaboration with other Partners through a variety of regional events, webinars, working groups, and other planned activities. The events on this page are a sample of those that are available to Partners throughout the year. Contact the TTP to become a Partner and have access to these events and more.\n2026 HFPP Events\nFEB 19\nHFPP/NHCAA Info Share Date & Time: Feb. 19, 2026 Time: 1pm - 4pm ET Location: Virtual\nHFPP/NHCAA Info Share\nDate & Time: Feb. 19, 2026\nTime: 1pm - 4pm ET\nLocation: Virtual\nMAY 21\nHFPP Info Share Date & Time: May 21, 2026 Time: 1pm - 4pm ET Location: Virtual\nHFPP Info Share\nDate & Time: May 21, 2026 Time: 1pm - 4pm ET\nLocation: Virtual\nJUN 11\nExecutive Board Meeting Date & Time: Jun. 11, 2026 Time: 1pm - 3pm ET Location: Virtual\nExecutive Board Meeting\nDate & Time: Jun. 11, 2026\nTime: 1pm - 3pm ET\nLocation: Virtual\nJUN 25\nNortheast Region Focus Group Meeting Date & Time: Jun. 25, 2026 Time: 2pm - 3pm ET Location: Virtual\nNortheast Region Focus Group Meeting\nDate & Time: Jun. 25, 2026 Time: 2pm - 3pm ET\nLocation: Virtual\nSEPT 17\nSouth Region Focus Group Meeting Date & Time: Sept. 17, 2026 Time: 2pm - 3pm ET Location: Virtual\nSouth Region Focus Group Meeting\nDate & Time: Sept. 17, 2026\nTime: 2pm - 3pm ET\nLocation: Virtual\nDEC 10\nWest Region Focus Group Meeting Date & Time: Dec. 10, 2026 Time: 2pm - 3pm ET Location: Virtual\nWest Region Focus Group Meeting\nDate & Time: Dec. 10, 2026 Time: 2pm - 3pm ET\nLocation: Virtual\n2025 HFPP Events\nJan 16\nExecutive Board Meeting Date & Time: Jan. 16, 2025 Time: 1pm - 3pm ET Location: Virtual\nExecutive Board Meeting\nDate & Time: Jan. 16, 2025\nTime: 1pm - 3pm ET\nLocation: Virtual\nFeb 27\nHFPP/NHCAA Info Share Date & Time: Feb. 27, 2025 Time: 1pm - 4pm ET Location: Virtual\nHFPP/NHCAA Info Share\nDate & Time: Feb. 27, 2025 Time: 1pm - 4pm ET\nLocation: Virtual\n2024 HFPP Events\nJan 18\nExecutive Board Meeting Date & Time: Jan. 18, 2024 Time: 11am - 5pm Location: Virtual\nExecutive Board Meeting\nDate & Time: Jan. 18, 2024\nTime: 11am - 5pm\nLocation: Virtual\nFeb 22\nHFPP/NHCAA Info Share Date & Time: Feb. 22, 2024 Time: 8:30am - 4pm Location: Virtual\nHFPP/NHCAA Info Share\nDate & Time: Feb. 22, 2024 Time: 8:30am - 4pm\nLocation: Virtual\nMar 21\nHFPP State Info Share Date & Time: Mar. 21, 2024 Time: 8:30am - 4pm Location: Virtual\nHFPP State Info Share\nDate & Time: Mar. 21, 2024 Time: 8:30am - 4pm\nLocation: Virtual\nApr 18\nExecutive Board Meeting Date & Time: Apr. 18, 2024 Time: 11am - 5pm Location: Virtual\nExecutive Board Meeting\nDate & Time: Apr. 18, 2024 Time: 11am - 5pm\nLocation: Virtual\nJun 12\nExecutive Board Meeting Date & Time: Jun. 12, 2024 Time: 11am - 5pm Location: Hybrid\nExecutive Board Meeting\nDate & Time: Jun. 12, 2024 Time: 11am - 5pm\nLocation: Hybrid\nJuN 13\nHFPP Info Share Date & Time: Jun. 13, 2024 Time: 8:30am - 4pm Location: Hybrid\nHFPP Info Share\nDate & Time: Jun. 13, 2024 Time: 8:30am - 4pm\nLocation: Hybrid"
  },
